Question: Weather Observation Station 8 (https://www.hackerrank.com/challenges/weather-observation-station-8/problem?isFullScreen=true)

select distinct city
from station
where city regexp '^[AEIOU].*[AEIOU]$' 
-- .* allows any char in between

